116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (- Smart home appliances are popular for their ability to simplify daily tasks and improve effectiveness and it automates floor cleaning, reducing manual effort. - Vacuuming alone may not suffice for maintaining floor hygiene in high dust or liquid spill areas and Incorporating mop feature into smart vacuum cleaner enhances its cleaning capabilities. - Project focuses on creating smart vacuum cleaner  and System aims to automate vacuuming and providing comprehensive cleaning solution. - Integration of sensors, motor control, enables intelligent navigation.)
/E (- Smart home appliances are popular for their ability to simplify daily tasks and improve effectiveness and it automates floor cleaning, reducing manual effort. - Vacuuming alone may not suffice for maintaining floor hygiene in high dust or liquid spill areas and Incorporating mop feature into smart vacuum cleaner enhances its cleaning capabilities. - Project focuses on creating smart vacuum cleaner  and System aims to automate vacuuming and providing comprehensive cleaning solution. - Integration of sensors, motor control, enables intelligent navigation.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
