/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (SLAM \(Simultaneous Localization and Mapping\): It enables a robot to map an environment and track its location simultaneously, essential for autonomous navigation. It combines localization \(estimating position\) and mapping \(building an environment map\) using data from sensors like Lidar and cameras. Challenges include handling sensor noise, data association, and real-time processing.)
/E (SLAM \(Simultaneous Localization and Mapping\): It enables a robot to map an environment and track its location simultaneously, essential for autonomous navigation. It combines localization \(estimating position\) and mapping \(building an environment map\) using data from sensors like Lidar and cameras. Challenges include handling sensor noise, data association, and real-time processing.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
